# Graphify keeps its durable, reviewable graph, report, and HTML in source
# control. Caches, manifests, cost history, runtime pointers, and optional
# exports are local rebuild artifacts.
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
!graphify-out/graph.html
!graphify-out/graph.json
